        meaning02: '<div class="line-block">\n  <p>*Roses are red<br>\nViolets are blue*</p>\n</div> Inline content is read in each line of a line block on its own (syntax-inline.md, Preliminaries), so a span across two lines is text. The rewrite closes and reopens the span on each line, which gives two strong spans instead of one.',
        toolEntry: "U-264",
