        meaning02: "Sample output is a span with the key `samp`, which a registered semantic span extension writes as `<samp>`; the key is an ordinary attribute of the core (C2-X-066). Rewrite only where the 0.1 host registered the `samp` extension.",
        toolEntry: "U-425",
